#### [NEW] [backend/services/anomaly_detector.py](file:///c:/nguyen/ĐA KTMT/backend/services/anomaly_detector.py)
`AnomalyDetector` class — mirrors the notebook logic:
- Loads 4 stage models + scalers + stats
- Maintains rolling buffer (200 time steps per stage)
- `predict(stage)` → returns z-score, threshold comparison, anomaly flag
- Uses `add_derivative_features()` and sequence creation from notebook

